---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Bryce Mason">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="card about-text">
        <p class="mini-label">About</p>
        <h1>Background, interests, and direction.</h1>

        <p>
          I am a senior at Whitman College majoring in Economics and
          Environmental Studies with a minor in Finance, graduating in May 2026.
          My liberal arts background has taught me to move across disciplines
          and get up to speed quickly, especially in work related to markets,
          strategy, business decision-making, and environmental systems. I am
          based in the San Francisco Bay Area.
        </p>

        <p>
          My experience includes a Finance and Sales Operations internship at G3
          Enterprises, finance and strategy project work for Perca, and M&amp;A
          research for Unsal Partners. Across those roles, I have worked on
          business analysis, research, and projects that required both
          structured thinking and practical problem solving.
        </p>

        <p>
          What interests me most is work at the intersection of finance,
          strategy, and emerging industries. I am especially interested in
          venture capital, climate tech, and analytical roles where I can
          continue building strong financial judgment while working on real
          business problems.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over time, I hope to keep developing as an investor and analyst while
          staying close to work that is thoughtful, practical, and tied to
          long-term trends in business, technology, and the environment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card photo-card">
        <img src="/linkedinphoto.jpg" alt="Bryce Mason" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) 280px;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .card {
    background: #1c1f22;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e33;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .mini-label {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: #a9c2af;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  p {
    color: #d0d4d8;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .photo-card {
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .photo-card img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 20px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .photo-card {
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .card {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>